{"id":"512d901e6f","t":"The Investor Who Sees the Future","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2024-10-20-03-13-48-1729437228982-193x278.jpg","n":112,"l":112,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future"},"u":1795038737175,"desc":"يكتسب كانغ جين – هو قدرة خارقة على استشراف المستقبل بعد حادث غير حياته أثناء خدمته العسكرية. مسلحا بهذه القوة الفريدة، ينغمس في عالم الاستثمارات، مستهدفا الشركات والأسواق المالية لتجميع الثروة ويصبح أفضل مستثمر فى العالم. لكن رؤيته تتجاوز مجرد کسب المال. تبدأ بصيرة كانغ جين هو في التأثير على الاقتصاد العالمي، والأنظمة السياسية، والشركات الكبرى، وحتى مسار العولمة نفسها الآن، وقد وضع نصب عينيه إعادة تشكيل عالم المال وما وراءه، فهو على وشك إعادة كتابة قواعد المستقبل.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","فنتازيا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/11/"},"13":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-investor-who-sees-the-future|/manga/the-investor-who-sees-the-future/14